{"seq":3,"slug":"network-flows","title":"网络流问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer/network-flows","wordCount":1817,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"网络流问题\">网络流问题</h1><p>把城市的供水管网、互联网的数据传输、工厂到仓库的货运、甚至求职者与岗位的匹配，都画成一张「节点 + 带容量的边」的图，你会发现它们共享同一个数学骨架——在图上把某种「流量」从源点送到汇点，使总流量最大或总费用最小。这就是网络流，一类有特殊结构的<a href=\"linear-programming-simplex\">线性规划</a>。它最迷人的地方在于：尽管没有显式加整数约束，它的最优解却自动是整数，因此能用比通用单纯形快得多的专用算法求解，绕开了<a href=\"integer-programming-bnb\">整数规划</a>的 NP 难诅咒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>网络流问题定义在一张有向图 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 上，每条边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 有容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，可能还有单位费用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。我们要在边上分配流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，满足两类约束：容量约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\le f_{ij}\\le u_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（流不能超过边的承载力），以及流量守恒——除源点和汇点外，每个节点的流入等于流出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{j} f_{ji} - \\sum_{j} f_{ij} = 0, \\quad \\forall i \\neq s, t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最大流问题求从源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 到汇 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 能推送的最大流量；最小费用流问题在满足给定流量需求下使总费用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum c_{ij} f_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最小。它们本质都是线性规划，但约束矩阵（节点-边关联矩阵）有一个珍贵性质——全幺模性（每个方阵子式都是 0、±1）。</p>\n<p>全幺模性带来一个奇迹般的结论：当右端项（容量、需求）都是整数时，线性规划的最优解自动取整数值，无需额外的整数约束。这正是网络流能避开整数规划 NP 难的根本原因——它戴着「离散决策」的外壳，却有「连续可解」的内核。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[网络流问题] --&gt; B[图 G=V,E&lt;br/&gt;边有容量与费用]&#10;    A --&gt; C[容量约束 0&lt;=f&lt;=u]&#10;    A --&gt; D[流量守恒&lt;br/&gt;流入=流出]&#10;    B --&gt; E[约束矩阵全幺模]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[LP 最优解自动取整]&#10;    F --&gt; G[避开整数规划 NP 难]\">graph TD\n    A[网络流问题] --&gt; B[图 G=V,E&lt;br/&gt;边有容量与费用]\n    A --&gt; C[容量约束 0&lt;=f&lt;=u]\n    A --&gt; D[流量守恒&lt;br/&gt;流入=流出]\n    B --&gt; E[约束矩阵全幺模]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[LP 最优解自动取整]\n    F --&gt; G[避开整数规划 NP 难]</pre><p>下表列出网络流家族的主要成员及其专用算法，它们都是同一框架的特例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>经典算法</th>\n<th>复杂度量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大流</td>\n<td>源到汇最大流量</td>\n<td>Ford-Fulkerson / Dinic</td>\n<td>多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小费用流</td>\n<td>满足需求下费用最小</td>\n<td>网络单纯形 / SSP</td>\n<td>多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分图匹配</td>\n<td>最大配对数</td>\n<td>匈牙利算法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输问题</td>\n<td>产销平衡下运费最小</td>\n<td>运输单纯形</td>\n<td>多项式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最大流与最小割-一枚硬币的两面\">最大流与最小割：一枚硬币的两面</h2><p>最大流问题问：从源点最多能推送多少流量到汇点？答案被一个优美的定理锁定——最大流最小割定理：网络的最大流量恰好等于最小割的容量。所谓「割」是把节点分成包含源的一侧和包含汇的一侧的一种切分，割的容量是所有从源侧指向汇侧的边容量之和。最小割就是容量最小的那种切分——它是整个网络的「瓶颈」。</p>\n<p>这个定理是<a href=\"../foundations/duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>里强对偶在网络上的具体化：最大流是原问题，最小割是其对偶，二者最优值相等。它的工程含义极为直接——若你想提升网络吞吐量，盲目扩容任何一条边都没用，只有扩容最小割上的瓶颈边才有效。</p>\n<p>求解最大流的经典思路是增广路径法：反复在「残量网络」里寻找一条从源到汇的还有余量的路径，沿它推送流量，直到再也找不到这样的路径——此时流量达到最大。Dinic 算法通过分层和阻塞流把效率提升到多项式级别，是实践中的常用选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[初始流量全为零] --&gt; B[构造残量网络]&#10;    B --&gt; C{存在从源到汇的&lt;br/&gt;增广路径?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[沿路径推送可行流量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[更新残量网络]&#10;    E --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[当前流即最大流&lt;br/&gt;= 最小割容量]\">flowchart TD\n    A[初始流量全为零] --&gt; B[构造残量网络]\n    B --&gt; C{存在从源到汇的&lt;br/&gt;增广路径?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[沿路径推送可行流量]\n    D --&gt; E[更新残量网络]\n    E --&gt; C\n    C --&gt;|否| F[当前流即最大流&lt;br/&gt;= 最小割容量]</pre><h2 id=\"最小费用流-把费用也算进来\">最小费用流：把费用也算进来</h2><p>很多实际问题不只问「能流多少」，更问「怎么流最省钱」。最小费用流在最大流的容量约束之上，给每条边加上单位流量费用，目标是在满足给定供需的前提下让总费用最小。它是网络流家族里表达力最强的成员——运输问题、指派问题、甚至带时间窗的简化调度，都能归约到它。</p>\n<p>求解的两条主线，一是连续最短路法 SSP：每次沿当前残量网络里费用最小的增广路径推流，逐步满足需求；二是网络单纯形法，它是<a href=\"linear-programming-simplex\">单纯形法</a>针对网络结构的特化版本，利用图结构把每次基变换做得极快，是大规模最小费用流的工业主力。</p>\n<p>运输问题是最小费用流的一个经典特例：若干产地有供应量、若干销地有需求量，每条产销线路有运费，求总运费最小的调运方案。当总供应等于总需求时它是平衡运输问题，可用专门的运输单纯形高效求解。它在供应链与物流中无处不在，相关的大规模工程化见<a href=\"../practice/or-applications\">运筹应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指派与匹配-网络流的离散外衣\">指派与匹配：网络流的离散外衣</h2><p>指派问题问的是：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个人分配给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 项任务，每人一任务、每任务一人，每种人-任务搭配有一个成本，求总成本最小的分配。它看起来是个纯组合问题（要在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span> 种排列里挑），但借助全幺模性，它其实是一个最小费用流，最优解保证取整（每个分配变量自然落在 0 或 1）。</p>\n<p>经典的匈牙利算法以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 解指派问题，远快于把它当一般<a href=\"integer-programming-bnb\">整数规划</a>来啃。更一般的二分图最大匹配——比如把求职者匹配到岗位、把订单匹配到骑手——同样可建模为最大流：加一个超级源连所有左节点、一个超级汇连所有右节点，每条边容量设为 1，最大流的值就是最大匹配数。</p>\n<p>这类问题的实践教训是：遇到「一对一分配」「资源与需求配对」的场景，先别急着写成通用整数规划，问一句「它是不是网络流」。一旦识别出网络结构，求解速度往往能从「跑几分钟」变成「跑几毫秒」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>表面形态</th>\n<th>真实结构</th>\n<th>加速效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务指派</td>\n<td>组合排列</td>\n<td>最小费用流</td>\n<td>匈牙利算法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>骑手派单</td>\n<td>离散匹配</td>\n<td>二分图最大流</td>\n<td>多项式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓配调运</td>\n<td>整数规划</td>\n<td>运输问题</td>\n<td>运输单纯形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>网络流是定义在图上的特殊线性规划，受容量约束与流量守恒支配，约束矩阵的全幺模性使 LP 最优解自动取整，避开整数规划 NP 难。</li>\n<li>最大流最小割定理是强对偶的网络版：最大流量等于最小割容量，最小割就是网络瓶颈，扩容瓶颈边才能提升吞吐。</li>\n<li>最小费用流是表达力最强的成员，用连续最短路法或网络单纯形求解；运输问题是其重要特例。</li>\n<li>指派与二分图匹配看似组合难题，实为网络流，匈牙利算法等专用算法远快于通用整数规划——识别网络结构是关键。</li>\n<li>网络流连接了<a href=\"linear-programming-simplex\">线性规划与单纯形</a>的算法、<a href=\"../foundations/duality-kkt\">对偶与 KKT 条件</a>的强对偶，其工程落地见<a href=\"../practice/or-applications\">运筹应用</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网络流问题","id":"网络流问题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最大流与最小割：一枚硬币的两面","id":"最大流与最小割-一枚硬币的两面"},{"level":2,"text":"最小费用流：把费用也算进来","id":"最小费用流-把费用也算进来"},{"level":2,"text":"指派与匹配：网络流的离散外衣","id":"指派与匹配-网络流的离散外衣"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"整数规划与分支定界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer/integer-programming-bnb"},"next":{"title":"梯度法与牛顿法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/gradient-newton-methods"}}